        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion U7, Rustic Ahwahnee Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe American Relic Collection Ahwahnee Handleset features a covered deadbolt for a sleek appearance. It is available in 3 finishes: antique pewter, medium bronze, and dark bronze--all of which have a slightly textured surface. The Ahwahnee Handleset with Covered Deadbolt is available in dummy and single cylinder functions. As part of the American Relic Collection, it recalls historic designs in a way that is in step with contemporary design aesthetics. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Fusion U7 American Relic Collection Ahwahnee Tubular Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Bump resistant cylinder.</li> \r\n<li>Solid brass SC1 keyway and 5 pin system with self lubricating solid brass plug & housing.</li>\r\n<li>High security strike.</li> \r\n<li>Reversible latch bolts for inside and outside swing.</li>\r\n<li>Minimal parts for easy installation.</li>\r\n<li>Matching latch, strike and screws for excellent appearance.</li>\r\n<li>Beveled interior screws with single slot for improved visual.</li>\r\n<li>No unsightly or difficult-to-inset set screws are used.</li>\r\n<li>Dual spring assist to eliminate \"knob wobble\" found in lesser products.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Fusion Ahwahnee Entrance Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Outside Plate Length: 19-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Outside Plate Width: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Inside Plate Length: 10-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Inside Plate Width: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Will fit standard 5-1/2\" on center door boring.</li>\r\n<li>Center of latch bore to center of bottom thrubolt for handle:  6-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backsets: 2-3/8\" and 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>One Year Finish Warranty.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Limited Warranty on workmanship, materials, and operation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Set:</b> For looks only. They are non-locking and non-latching. They are used as a pull or to match trim.</li>\r\n<br>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder:</b> The deadbolt is operated by a key on the outside and a thumb turn on the inside while the handle underneath the deadbolt is operated by a thumb latch on the outside and either a knob or a lever on the inside.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Ahwahnee Handleset with Covered Deadbolt, Fusion U7",
                "description": "Fusion U7, Ahwahnee Handleset with Covered Deadbolt - The American Relic Collection Ahwahnee Handleset features a covered deadbolt for a sleek appearance. It is available in 3 finishes: antique pewter, medium bronze, and dark bronze--all of which have a slightly textured surface. The Ahwahnee Handleset with Covered Deadbolt is available in dummy and single cylinder functions. As part of the American Relic Collection, it recalls historic designs in a way that is in step with contemporary design aesthetics.",
